{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2021a.q14.material.recovered", "text": "材料：教师为幼儿制作了一个玩具灶（右图），投放了羽毛、棉花、小木棒、乒乓球等不同材质的物品和扇子，让幼儿猜测哪些物品能被风吹起来并进行验证。小牛猜想羽毛和棉花能飞起来，就开始扇风，结果发现他们确实能飞起来，他使的劲大了，发现乒乓球也能飞起来了。一直旁观的小雷惊讶地说：“原来用劲儿扇乒乓球也能飞起来呀！”14游戏中小牛、小雷都在学习吗（4分）？请分别说明理由。（", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "98947016711a1553b55d30683e16cc14863781fe03b5888f156465989e43f854", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 950, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1131, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "98947016711a1553b55d30683e16cc14863781fe03b5888f156465989e43f854"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2021a.q14"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m4.k02", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.manage", "ntce.youer.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2021a.q14"], "word_count": 181, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "98947016711a1553b55d30683e16cc14863781fe03b5888f156465989e43f854", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 950, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1131, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "